  "principles": [
    "Mastery before acceleration",
    "Academic difficulty is separate from motor-control difficulty",
    "Mistakes trigger support, not punishment",
    "Use Caribbean and OECS-relevant contexts",
    "Deterministic scoring for mathematics and factual assessment",
    "Revisit weak concepts through spaced review",
    "No advertising, public free-text chat, or location sharing in child learning worlds"
  ],
